Troubleshooting
Issue: "ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'fake_useragent'"
Solution:

source venv/bin/activate
pip install fake-useragent
Issue: Mock server not responding
Solution:

Check if port 8080 is already in use: sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 8080
Kill existing process: sudo kill -9 <PID>
Restart mock server
Issue: All requests failing with connection errors
Solution:

Verify internet connectivity: ping -c 3 google.com
Check if firewall is blocking: sudo ufw status
Try alternative test URL: http://httpbin.org/get
Issue: User agents not rotating
Solution:

Clear fake-useragent cache: rm -rf ~/.fake_useragent/
Reinstall: pip install --upgrade fake-useragent
